2. Modifications (Arphic Public License sec. 2)
-----------------------------------------------

The bundled file is NOT the original AnimCJK distribution. Modified 2026-09 by
tooling/fetch_animcjk.dart. What was changed, and how:
  - only the two `<path d="...">` attribute sets per character are extracted: the
    outline paths (`id`-bearing paths) and the single-line skeleton paths (paths
    carrying `clip-path="url(#...)"`);
  - the extracted paths are stored as JSON keyed by character (`outlines`,
    `skeletons`) instead of as `.svg` files; all SVG markup, element ids and clip
    path definitions are discarded;
  - a subset (the HSK 1 character set) is shipped rather than the whole AnimCJK
    collection;
  - conversions used: Unicode code point -> decimal for the `svgsZhHans` path.

In line with Arphic Public License sec. 2(b), these modifications are made
